WEBVTT

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:13.820
Run!

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.300
Get out of here!

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:19.660
You're a naughty one!

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:39.350
Who was that girl?

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:15.480
Red Riding Hood's Forest

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:24.370
So a human was turned into a villain...

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:28.750
Reina, Tao, Shane!

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:41.640
Reina, is he hurt?

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.430
He'll be fine,

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:45.800
though he might not wake up for a while.

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:48.430
Don't let it get to you, new kid.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:51.520
Those guys just attack 
anything they lay eyes on.

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:53.110
Tao's right.

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:56.660
If I'd seen a girl being 
attacked by a villain,

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:58.940
I would've connected 
and fought, too, I think.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:02.610
But I can't say I approve of our new 
member going off on his own.

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:04.200
I'm sorry, Shane...

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:07.500
And I don't see the girl anywhere...

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.500
R-Red Riding Hood...

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:10.790
Red Riding Hood?

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.940
Is that her name?

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:15.610
Please... the village...

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:18.370
Red Riding Hood must be...

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:22.510
I'm sorry.

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:26.720
Don't sweat it! Just leave it to me, 
the boss of the Tao family!

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:29.770
I never said you could 
call us the Tao family!

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:31.600
Come on, Princess...

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:34.190
Um, about last night...

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:36.510
He doesn't remember anything
 about being a villain.

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:37.860
I know, but...

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:42.240
The contents of my Book of Fate 
are starting to become twisted...

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:43.360
Book of Fate?

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:46.370
Is there anything in your Book of Fate

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:50.680
that might be a clue?

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:55.790
Ever since that monster appeared, we... all...

00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:57.710
Hang on!

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:00.710
Don't worry. He just passed out.

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:03.970
Being turned into a villain 
probably isn't doing him any favors.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.220
But if there are villains here,

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.640
this world... No, this Story Zone

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:11.770
has a Chaos Teller 
that's rewriting fates, right?

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:13.230
That's right, Ex.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:19.510
We need to find that Chaos Teller and
 restore everybody's fate to what it should be.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:27.020
Village sighted up ahead.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:35.040
Thank you for saving our friend, but...

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:37.130
Who are you? Where are you from?

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:38.290
The strange way you're dressed...

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:40.670
We... We're travelers!

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:42.690
From a faraway land!

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:48.600
There's nothing in my Book of Fate
 about meeting any travelers...

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.420
Mine, either!

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:51.640
What's going to happen now?

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:53.310
Calm down.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:55.190
Elder!

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.770
But I'm scared...

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.520
I know.

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:03.360
None of what's happening
 is in anyone's Book of Fate.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:07.070
The black monsters 
in the depths of the forest...

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:09.280
Red Riding Hood's disappearance... 
None of it.

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:11.080
So she hasn't come back to the village?

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:13.660
No. She's been missing for a week.

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:17.330
This girl you call Red Riding Hood...
What is her name?

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:19.500
What's in a name?

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.210
Red Riding Hood is Red Riding Hood.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:23.550
It's a name that's been passed 
down through the generations.

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:25.550
Passed down?

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:30.430
My Book of Fate said that I would someday
 give birth to Red Riding Hood.

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:31.640
Then you're...

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:33.890
Yes, I'm Red Riding Hood's mother.

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:42.190
Red Riding Hood was asked to deliver
 wine and bread to her grandmother

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:45.170
who lived on the other side of the forest.

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:50.620
A wolf appeared in the woods 
and told her to take the long way around.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.910
While she did, the wolf ate up her grandmother...

00:05:55.860 --> 00:06:01.290
and then lay in her bed pretending to be her.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:03.170
And when Red Riding Hood arrived...

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:09.130
Our village has sent out many 
Red Riding Hoods over the year.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:13.060
I used to be Red Riding Hood myself.

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:14.060
You?!

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:16.730
That was about seventy years ago now.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.730
It was so dark and smelly in the wolf's belly...

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:22.060
I was so scared!

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:23.440
Come on...

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:26.860
But why would you send her out 
knowing she'd be eaten?

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:28.320
No need to fear.

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:34.240
Saving Red Riding Hood from 
the wolf's stomach is my fate.

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.960
I still can't find her!

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:40.870
What should I do?

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:44.290
I'm sorry. I got separated from 
my friends in the forest, too...

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:46.510
It's those black monsters' fault!

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:48.470
This village is doomed!

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:51.020
What do we do, boss?

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:55.140
We need to find the Chaos Teller
 responsible for all this.

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:56.200
That girl...

00:06:56.650 --> 00:07:01.290
If that girl is the main character 
of this story, no, of this Story Zone...

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:03.560
The Chaos Teller must be near her.

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:04.980
That's right, Ex.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:07.860
If Red Riding Hood
 is the main character here...

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:10.940
This must be Red Riding Hood's Story Zone.

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:12.490
Okay, got it!

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:14.800
Don't worry about a thing, guys.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:16.240
Yours truly, Tao, will find—

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:17.700
I'm going out to look again.

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:20.990
I'll go, too!

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:23.500
No, leave it to me.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:25.790
She's a smart girl.

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:28.540
She must be hiding somewhere safe.

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:32.840
Yours truly, Tao—

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:34.930
Let us accompany you!

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:37.850
You were the last ones to see her...

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.060
It would be a help if you came along.

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:41.810
But I can't guarantee your safety.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:42.500
Okay.

00:07:46.470 --> 00:07:47.570
It's this way, right?

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:50.580
Where Ex said he saw the girl?

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:51.860
Hey!

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.370
Oh?

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:58.370
I swear, you get lost easier 
than anybody I know.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:01.580
H-Hey now!
Don't talk about me like I'm useless!

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.080
It's nothing new.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.670
Not you too, Shane!

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:09.000
I'm going to save Red Riding Hood 
with my own hands, no matter what.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.340
Like your Book of Fate says, right?

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:12.300
No...

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:15.930
She's a smart girl. 
She's curious about everything.

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:20.180
She used to ask all kinds of questions 
about the animals in the forest.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:23.520
I think of her as my own daughter.

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:28.360
Even if it weren't in my Book of Fate,
 I would still save her.

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:31.360
That howl!

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:32.860
Has the wolf already...

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:33.990
It's dangerous to go alone!

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.280
I'm coming, Red Riding Hood!

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:36.150
Hey!

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:41.770
Where'd he go?

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:43.620
Look!

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:45.620
Over there!

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:51.760
The wolf?

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:53.170
No, that's a villain!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.340
Princess, you check the cave with the new kid!

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:57.200
Shane, we'll follow him!

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:58.470
Roger that!

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:04.980
You're...

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:25.270
Dang, he's fast!

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:26.450
Brother Tao!

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:29.420
This is...

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:33.490
Yes! A traditional percussion lock rifle, right?!

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:36.050
It seems to have been 
modified from a flintlock.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.970
Do you think it was created 
when this Story Zone was born?

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.120
Either way, it's incredibly rare...

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:41.740
<i>There she goes again...</i>

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:44.680
I can't believe we found
 something so incredible!

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:48.440
Good, you're safe.

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:50.520
Why did you run away last night?

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:54.990
I've never seen anyone 
dressed like you before.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:58.070
I thought you were with 
that scary black thing.

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:00.070
Don't worry. You're okay now.

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:04.180
You really are smart, aren't you?

00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:09.000
This cave is a good hiding spot. 
It's well hidden.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.090
You tried your best to stay safe, didn't you?

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:13.210
You did great.

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:15.460
Thank you.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:18.550
Hey, Princess!

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:20.390
That's Tao and Shane!

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:22.260
The hunter's gun...

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:24.220
Then that villain...

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:26.600
It might have been the hunter transformed.

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:27.600
It couldn't have...

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:30.650
The Chaos Teller's influence 
is increasing more and more.

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.980
This Story Zone's not going to last long.

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:36.440
You can detect a Chaos Teller's 
presence, right, Reina?

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:39.950
I'm sure it's in this Story Zone,
 but I don't know where...

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:44.110
Sounds like we need to head back 
to the village and regroup.

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:49.210
I'm worried....
 I want to go to grandma's house.

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:52.460
I know how you feel, 
but the forest is dangerous right now.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:53.340
Yeah.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:01.930
How are you feeling?

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:03.260
Are you tired?

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.720
I'm fine.

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:07.750
You really love your grandma, don't you?

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:09.600
I do, but...

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:14.020
I have to get eaten by the Big Bad Wolf...

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:16.510
You're not scared?

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:19.360
Of course I am.

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:24.930
The day I read my Book of Fate,
 I was so scared that I couldn't even sleep.

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:27.030
Hey, Red Riding Hood...

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:30.580
I have a childhood friend...

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:34.500
who believed in their Book of Fate, 
and worked hard ever since they were a kid.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:38.380
So I'm sure you can do your best, too.

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:41.100
What's your friend doing now?

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:43.290
Living happily.

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:45.300
I see...

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:47.110
But...

00:11:47.110 --> 00:11:48.520
Don't worry.

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:52.100
Even if the Big Bad Wolf eats you,

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:54.400
we'll save you!

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:55.890
Really?

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:56.560
Yeah.

00:11:56.560 --> 00:11:57.650
I promise.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:11:59.900
Thank you.

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.450
Oh, right!

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:04.410
Are you hungry, mister?

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:07.830
I've got some bread.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:11.770
I can't eat that. 
That's for your grandmother.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:22.450
It's strangely quiet...

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:28.560
Mother!

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:31.640
Something's wrong!

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:32.730
Don't tell me...

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:33.490
Don't let her see!

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:39.630
No way!

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:42.190
It's just like the villager we saved!

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:47.520
We're surrounded...

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:50.120
Now!

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:58.080
It doesn't seem like we're being followed.

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:01.250
You should've said something before you fired.

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:03.260
My ears are still ringing.

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:06.970
This rifle's even better than I thought!

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:08.670
Seems pretty accurate, too!

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:10.680
I can't wait to take it apart later!

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.070
S-Sure...

00:13:12.070 --> 00:13:13.600
Some other time, though.

00:13:15.180 --> 00:13:17.310
In any event, where do we go now?

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.020
Grandma's house!

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:21.650
Grandma's house has to be safe!

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:29.780
Is that it?

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:36.250
Everybody, be careful.

00:13:36.450 --> 00:13:37.870
Yeehaw!

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:43.250
Where are you, grandma?

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:49.860
No sign of a fight...

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:51.090
I see.

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:53.100
I've mostly figured it out.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:55.050
What do you mean, Shane?

00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:59.620
Red Riding Hood, Red Riding Hood.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:04.150
That bread's a week old.
 Why isn't it moldy?

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:07.400
Huh? I don't know...

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:09.410
Shane, what are you doing?

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:11.240
Red Riding Hood, Red Riding Hood.

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:16.830
Why isn't that wine bottle 
in your basket full?

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:20.420
Maybe somebody drank some?

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:22.670
Red Riding Hood, Red Riding Hood.

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:26.630
Why did you bring us here?

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.510
There's only one reason, my dear.

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:32.550
To feed you to the wolf!

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:34.760
What?

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:36.570
This can't be...

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:43.680
That was too close for comfort.

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:47.220
You guys are really fast!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:50.860
I can't rewrite you like I did the villagers,

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:53.490
so I thought I'd burn you alive
in this house instead!

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:55.950
Rewrite? You mean their Books of Fate?

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:57.660
That's the power of a Chaos Teller!

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:00.300
That's right!

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:06.880
Why did the Chaos Teller 
possess Red Riding Hood?

00:15:07.110 --> 00:15:10.470
'Cause everybody's so mean to me!

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:12.890
Like the wolf, you know?

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:20.100
He tricked me.

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:23.900
He used me to get close to my mother.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.280
All men are wolves, right?

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:30.380
So I gave him what he wanted.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:33.160
Everyone else was the same.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.780
"Grow up soon!"

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:37.640
"Go to grandma's house soon!"

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:43.120
They all knew the wolf was going
 to eat me, but nobody really cared!

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:44.920
That's not true!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:48.340
Your mother and the hunter 
were both worried about you!

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:55.220
They were just worried that the wolf 
wouldn't eat me like he was supposed to, right?

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:58.600
No! The hunter said you were 
like a daughter to him!

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:00.100
Lies, lies, lies!

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:02.060
You're all liars!

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:04.940
And I'll make you all suffer!

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:14.160
No...

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:17.620
The Chaos Teller is resonating 
with Red Riding Hood's fears!

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:21.040
We can't talk our way of this one.

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:22.330
Yup!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:25.290
Time for the Tao family to kick some butt!

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.630
Everyone, do you have your 
Bookmark of Guidance?

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:30.960
Ex!

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:36.550
I promised you, Red Riding Hood, didn't I?

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:40.430
I'll save you from the 
nightmare imprisoning you!

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:41.730
Alice!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:43.550
Cinderella!

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.300
Goliath!

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:47.080
Robin Hood!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:49.110
Connect!

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:12.880
Is it time for another adventure
 in Wonderland?

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:30.330
Locked on!

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:39.030
There's more!

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.410
Leave them to me!

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:56.880
They just keep coming!

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:59.700
Tao, clear us a path to the Chaos Teller!

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:00.260
And what then?

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:02.180
Ex will defeat it!

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:04.700
You promised, didn't you?

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:06.100
I know.

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:15.860
My own strength is all I can count on!

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:17.860
Myth of Savage Valor!

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:19.740
Now!

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:40.220
Sherwood Gale!

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:47.380
How about a waltz with me?

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:50.140
Unbreakable Glass Slippers!

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:58.860
I'll teach you what it means to be a lady!

00:19:00.730 --> 00:19:04.200
Wonder Labyrinth!

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:18.380
Why...

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:20.090
Why?

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:23.020
Nobody understands how I feel.

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:24.590
That's not true.

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:27.930
So let's go back to the village.

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:29.560
I can't.

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:32.900
I'm a naughty child now...

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:34.150
Don't worry.

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:37.020
Once Reina tunes everything, 
it'll all go back to normal.

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:40.900
Yup. And all your memories will vanish.

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:42.530
Mister?

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:53.110
Return this story to its proper form...

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:01.260
Teller of tales, 
drowned in a maelstrom of chaos...

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:05.850
By my words, I now begin the tuning...

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:34.420
It's finally tomorrow, huh?

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:35.120
Yup!

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:37.500
Red Riding Hood...

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:39.270
What is it, mother?

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:54.110
You can do this, my darling little girl...

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:04.900
I heard the hunter's marrying 
Red Riding Hood's mother.

00:21:05.060 --> 00:21:09.490
Well, a parent remarrying 
is a delicate situation for a kid.

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:12.950
I guess the Chaos Teller 
resonated with her anxieties, huh?

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:16.670
The villagers turning into villains,
 our coming here...

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:18.780
They won't remember any of it.

00:21:18.780 --> 00:21:21.920
Now the story will play out like it should.

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:25.550
In the end, she's still going 
to get eaten by a wolf, though...

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:28.590
You don't need to accept me 
as your father right away.

00:21:28.940 --> 00:21:32.850
But I want you to know 
that I'm telling the truth

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:36.760
when I say that I love both you
 and your mother very much.

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:39.530
I can't just accept it immediately...

00:21:42.790 --> 00:21:45.740
But I'm a smart girl, you know!

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:47.910
I'll give it plenty of thought.

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:49.530
Is that enough for now?

00:21:49.690 --> 00:21:51.370
Yeah, of course.

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:52.960
Then it's a promise.

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:54.120
Great.

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:56.290
A promise...

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:56.910
What's wrong?

00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:59.250
No, it's nothing.

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:02.260
Ow!

00:22:02.260 --> 00:22:04.550
Feel any better, new kid?

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:07.260
Stop calling me that, Tao!

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:11.260
Yeah? How about just "kid," then?

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:12.310
"Kid"?

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:13.890
It's perfect.

00:22:13.890 --> 00:22:15.470
Let's get going.

00:22:15.470 --> 00:22:16.180
Yup!

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:20.100
The Tao family's journey to wipe out
 the Chaos Tellers continues!

00:22:20.100 --> 00:22:21.810
Stop trying to show off.

00:22:21.810 --> 00:22:25.610
I'm the one who started 
this journey! I'm the leader!

00:22:25.790 --> 00:22:27.140
I'm fine with that.

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:28.990
You're the leader, Princess.

00:22:28.990 --> 00:22:32.120
But I'm the boss!

00:22:32.350 --> 00:22:36.130
Knock it off! Jeez...

00:22:47.790 --> 00:22:51.920
<i>When we're born, we're given a book.</i>

00:22:53.340 --> 00:22:59.420
<i>A script containing everything about us,
 the meaning of our lives... Everything.</i>

00:23:00.970 --> 00:23:02.300
<i>"The Book of Fate."</i>

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:13.200
<i>We follow these scripts written by 
an omniscient being known as the Storyteller,</i>

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:21.140
<i>playing out the roles we're given from 
the day we're born until the day we die.</i>

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:39.150
<i>So tell me...</i>

00:23:41.030 --> 00:23:44.810
<i>When someone's Book of Fate
 is filled with nothing but blank pages,</i>

00:23:45.300 --> 00:23:49.070
<i>what sort of role, what sort of fate,
 are they expected to play?</i>

00:23:51.180 --> 00:23:53.570
Kid! What are you doing?

00:23:53.830 --> 00:23:55.570
We'll leave you behind!

00:23:56.430 --> 00:23:57.780
Sorry!
